,439,974</ix:nonFraction> and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_PbsollWVkkaaL7ZUNUri9A" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_6_30_2025_us-gaap_AntidilutiveSecuritiesExcludedFromComputationOfEarningsPerShareByAntidilutiveSecuritiesAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_GP1d5GRzXkuL5sLrHKc2pQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AntidilutiveSecuritiesExcludedFromComputationOfEarningsPerShareAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_RSQ0jkQS5kG8dFKmmolm9w">3,434,432</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock as of June 30, 2026 and 2025, respectively, were not included in the computation of diluted net income per share due to their anti-dilutive effect. Such securities could have a dilutive effect in future periods.</p></ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_Zzms_WwTzkuvUoA51zVuwg" name="us-gaap:SegmentReportingPolicyPolicyTextBlock" id="Tb_H7p7Zho660G0EqmgBJfQJg" continuedAt="Tb_H7p7Zho660G0EqmgBJfQJg_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-size:11pt;font-weight:bold;">Segment Information </b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-weight:bold;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">We operate in <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_segment_hJg-c4IGqEih_Y06-RFnHA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_6_30_2025_ev0enFWbOEWGOgNeA3AyYw" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:NumberOfReportableSegments" scale="0" id="Narr_ISKfM3JkyUCIpc1wtlqLFg"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_segment_hJg-c4IGqEih_Y06-RFnHA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_Zzms_WwTzkuvUoA51zVuwg" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:NumberOfReportableSegments" scale="0" id="Narr_GsUlcBU_VEucbYwG6PxijQ"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_segment_hJg-c4IGqEih_Y06-RFnHA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_6_30_2025_ev0enFWbOEWGOgNeA3AyYw" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:NumberOfOperatingSegments" scale="0" id="Narr_KnL4fB4gj0mK-RZbGobjvw"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_segment_hJg-c4IGqEih_Y06-RFnHA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_Zzms_WwTzkuvUoA51zVuwg" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:NumberOfOperatingSegments" scale="0" id="Narr_TPJCK-JVWE274775HcyA2Q">one</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> segment, the development, license, implementation, and support of our customer service infrastructure software solutions. Operating segments are identified as components of an enterprise for which discrete financial information is available and regularly reviewed by our Chief Operating Decision-Maker in order to make decisions about resources to be allocated to the segment and assess its performance. Our chief operating decision-makers (CODMs) under ASC 280, <i style="font-style:italic;">Segment Reporting</i>, are our executive management team. Our CODMs review financial information presented on a consolidated basis for purposes of making operating decisions and assessing financial performance. The CODMs regularly evaluate non-GAAP operating income, which is defined as income from operations as presented on the </p></ix:nonNumeric></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:12pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;">66</span></p></div></div>
