<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:79.3%;border:0;margin:30pt 10.35% 30pt 10.35%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:10.35%;padding-right:10.35%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:41.75pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:12pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a style="font-size:10pt;" href="#Toc"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><a id="_91ebde44_aa59_4690_8671_fafb919f4fca"></a><a id="Tc_OgDcBqXio0m4In4zjuh-DQ_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_jCJ8RHU1Mk-CP9p_8hSwGA_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_oTWUbun-tkOhLNI4MOMKDA_2_5"></a><a id="Tc_vcIVcLAQtUWw9Pz0X5lOEA_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_PKMCi5rCGEK15iHczjnZzA_3_2"></a><a id="Tc_3_Ce1UueGkGc3LMH376XeA_3_5"></a><a id="Tc_gei4__fQk0G-cJm4mDIwig_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_9j0_HT79dUC9_67BxWJ40Q_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_l630zaRoIkKIoJbPRqKbhw_5_6"></a><a id="Tc_gy7AA7dEx0KXMYCvL13NqA_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_vN0E1kEMuU-7-DWUBfBN7Q_6_2"></a><a id="Tc_ySxjALLz1EGcyBD3gv0tnQ_6_5"></a><ix:continuation id="Tb_QhkyKIonWEupVcOKiWUnag_cont4"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">earnings, in the form of dividends or otherwise, we would be subject to withholding taxes payable to the foreign jurisdiction. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">For the fiscal years ended June 30, 2026 and 2025, we have <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_sMr5IIFRlUiSeWlTG0C_Gw" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_Zzms_WwTzkuvUoA51zVuwg" decimals="-5" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="egan:TaxCutsAndJobsActOf2017GlobalIntangibleLowTaxedIncome" scale="6" id="Narr_8nyDLoCTF06qjnFm-Ntgeg">zero</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_sMr5IIFRlUiSeWlTG0C_Gw" contextRef="Du